parameters.text:
=You are an expert email marketing copywriter. Create a highly personalized, persuasive email based on the user's behavior.

User Data:
{{ $json.userProfile || 'Name: {{ $json.userId }}' }}

Behavior:
Event: {{ $json.eventType }}
Product: {{ $json.productViewed }}
Page: {{ $json.pageUrl }}

Segment: {{ $json.segment }}

Write a compelling subject line and email body under 180 words. Use friendly, brand-aligned tone. Include clear CTA.

parameters.jsCode:
const item = $input.item.json;
return {
  json: {
    ...item,
    subject: item.subject || `Great to see you interested in ${item.productViewed || 'our products'}!`,
    emailBody: item.response || item.text || 'Default personalized content...',
    campaignType: item.segment,
    sendTime: new Date(Date.now() + 3600000).toISOString()
  }
};
